```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Chain
    participant S as Source record
    participant A as Audit log
    C->>S: re-read grounded facts (identity)
    C->>A: append step:identity
    C->>S: re-read grounded facts (sanctions)
    C->>A: append step:sanctions
    C->>S: re-read grounded facts (PEP)
    C->>A: append step:pep
    C->>S: re-read grounded facts (risk)
    C->>A: append step:risk
    C->>S: re-read grounded facts (decision)
    C->>A: append decision
    Note over C: any drift vs verified facts fails the chain to human review
```
